<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Spec2Control: Automating PLC/DCS Control-Logic Engineering
<br class="ltx_break">from Natural Language Requirements with LLMs
<br class="ltx_break">- A Multi-Plant Evaluation</h1>
